# ubntbox.bytes - byte edits of the vendor bin/ubntbox (multi-call binary with the config generator templates).
# Line: offset (hex), old bytes (hex), new bytes (hex). The old bytes are a whole template string around the
# changed bytes, so every edit is checked. Input and output sha256 below; any other ubntbox is refused.
# Template lines are disabled by turning their first byte into "#" (or "null::" into "#ull::" in inittab
# lines); the udapi-bridge config path becomes /dev/null; "ls" before the beacon test becomes ": ".
